{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1376885-a-unified-theory-of-ether","id":1376885,"title":"A Unified Theory of Ether","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-27T18:44:43-07:00","id":1376885,"title":"A Unified Theory of Ether","content":"One of my players is playing an Etherite and is having some trouble grasping the basics of the Ether-paradigm. I put together the text below as an attempt at providing some in-game guidance.<br /> <br /> What I'm looking for are responding theories. What is your take on how a Scientist from the Society of Ether should approach this Paradigm?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>A Unified Theory of Ether</b><br /> By Dr. Farrah P. Milestone, CE<br /> Published by Free University Press, 1932<br /> <br /> <b>Synopsis:</b><br /> Building on the discovery of the Big Bang as the origin of the Universe by Georges Lema\u00eetre and Dr. Proxima\u2019s Theory of Sub-Atomic Ether, the Unified Theory of Ether supposes that Ether is ever-present in every strata of Reality.<br /> <br /> Whereas it is established that an atom is the smallest constituent unit of ordinary matter that constitutes a chemical element; every solid, liquid, gas, and plasma is composed of neutral or ionized atoms, and every atom is composed of a nucleus and one or more electrons bound to the nucleus. Dr. Milestone\u2019s discovery purports that what allows the electrons to move freely around their gravitational nucleus is their suspension in Ether. By this it is resolved that there are at least two Etherspaces, the External Etherspace and the Internal Etherspace.<br /> <br /> <b>The Unified Theory of Ether, applied to the Sciences:</b><br /> <u>Correspondence:</u> As all things consist of Ether, Etherspace is ever-present, akin to, but not similar to, a sixth dimension. Through subjecting an object to calibrated vibrations, it can be unmoored from its physical location and moved through Internal Etherspace to a different and discreet location. Due to the quantum nature of Internal Etherspace, such moves will appear to be virtually instantaneous.<br /> <br /> <u>Entropy:</u> By analyzing and quantifying the frequency of Ether in a pattern, it becomes possible to predict and influence the outcome of a chain of events. It is likewise possible to accelerate of delay the natural breakdown of physical patterns.<br /> <br /> <u>Forces:</u> Ether in its quantum state has certain polarities and through affecting the polarity of Ether in an object or area, its conductivity can be altered, rendering energy more or less effective.<br /> <u>Life:</u> As all forms consist of atoms, organic life, from the simplest bacteria up to and including humanity, is governed by Ether. It therefore follows that through manipulating Ether, organic patterns can be affected and altered.<br /> <br /> <u>Matter:</u> The potential for manipulation of inorganic matter is virtually limitless.<br /> <br /> <u>Mind:</u> Though the psychology of the unconscious itself is an abstract, and therefore unaffiliated with the physical, the Id itself resides in the grey matter of the brain. This tethering of the abstract to the concrete provides certain applications of the Unified Theory of Ether to the Science of Mind. Movements of electrical currents inside the brain can be analysed and influenced in a manner similar to the Science of Forces.<br /> <br /> <u>Prime:</u> Quintessence being Ether in its rawest form, harnessing it is the very foundation of the Unified Theory of Ether.<br /> <br /> <u>Spirit:</u> The Umbra and its affiliated phenomena exist in the fifth dimension and therefore is in its very essence unaffiliated with Ether. For this reason, the methodologies of Ether Science cannot be applied on a one-to-one basis. However, manipulating frequency and polarity of Ether in physical patterns has proven to be extremely effective in transporting such patterns from the physical Universe into the Umbralverse. Likewise, physical patterns in the Umbralverse can be manipulated to alter their impact on its native patterns.<br /> <br /> <u>Time:</u> As of the publishing date of this title, no clear connection between Ether and the fourth dimension has been proven. Nevertheless, Ether appears to carry within it certain \u201cechoes\u201d of past patterns. This has provided some means of accessing limited historical data although no way of discerning patterns upstream in the flow of Time has presented itself to date. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Any technology distinguishable from magic is insufficiently advanced.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12101-nitromidas","name":"Nitromidas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-28T19:45:14-07:00","id":1377046,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1360544-homebrew-headcanons?p=1363413#post1363413\">My thoughts on the Society of Ether</a>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1360544-homebrew-headcanons?p=1363459#post1363459\"> And No One of Consequence's thoughts on Etherite style</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/